# Remotion kit & compositions

## Kit (`src/kit/`)

- `SkeletonScreen` — layout chrome + pulsing blocks; accept layout variant props.
- `WireConnector` — animated path draw (stroke-dashoffset / interpolate).
- `PageTransition` — use with `@remotion/transitions` `TransitionSeries`.
- Keep presentational; timing from local frame; content via props.

## Presentations (`presentations/<slug>/`)

```
presentations/<slug>/
  meta.ts          # title, description, formats
  Demo.tsx         # or Main.tsx — Series of scenes
  scenes/          # one file per page/scene
```

## Formats

Import presets from `src/formats.ts`. Register compositions for needed variants:

- `16x9-1080`, `16x9-4k`, `9x16-1080`, `9x16-4k`
- FPS 30

Same component tree; only width/height change.

## Studio editability

Prefer Zod schemas / inlined `defaultProps` on `<Composition>` for assets and copy so Studio can swap files after generation.

## Avoid

- Hard-coded absolute frame offsets duplicated across scenes — prefer `Series` / `TransitionSeries`.
- Global CSS that breaks Remotion AbsoluteFill layouts.
- Cards/dashboard chrome in hero-style scenes unless the scene is interactive UI demo.

## Explainer components
Named kit to grow: CompareCards, FlowLoop, PipelineCards, FanOut, CounterBar, ProofScreencap, SlashChip, SyntheticCursor. beats.md is required in each presentation folder.
